{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"prelim-2005-meet-science2-34","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2005,"subject":"physics","number":34,"points":null,"unitId":"physics-wave-optics","unitLabel":"파동·광학","topic":"파장·굴절·빛","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["physics-wave-optics"],"stem":"그림은파장이λ 인두빛이두매질A, B에입사하여나란히\n통과한후, 한점에모이는것을나타낸다. 두매질의길이는\n20λ 로같고, 매질A와매질B의굴절률은각각1.3과1.8이다.\n두빛에대한<보기>의설명중옳은것을모두고른것은?\n(단, 입사할때두빛의위상은같고, 매질을통과한후두빛의\n경로차는생기지않는다.)\n<보기>\nㄱ. 빛의파장은매질A에서가매질B에서보다크다.\nㄴ. 빛의속력은매질A에서가매질B에서보다작다.\nㄷ. 한점에모인두빛은보강간섭을한다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t011"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t012"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t013"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t014"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t015"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":677,"height":310,"region":0,"bbox":[23.35,71.34,270.8,124.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/prelim-2005-meet-science2-34/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":744,"height":180,"region":0,"bbox":[14.15,278.54,297.6,72.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t007","t008","t009","t010"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/prelim-2005-meet-science2-34/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":11,"sourceRect":[37.45,67.46,360.0,465.951],"width":322.55,"height":398.491,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[23.35,71.34,270.8,124.0],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[14.15,278.54,297.6,72.0],"section":"stem"},{"id":"t001","type":"text","text":"34. 그림은파장이λ 인두빛이두매질A, B에입사하여나란히","bbox":[5.0,5.0,307.267,11.166],"spans":[{"text":"34.","bbox":[5.0,5.134,12.99,11.032],"origin":[5.0,13.96],"size":10.753,"flags":0,"font":"T10"},{"text":" 그림은","bbox":[17.99,5.13